  "detailed_description": "The “Agriculture Engineering (Mechanical) Scheme” is a State Plan Scheme, which is implemented by the Department of Agriculture &amp;amp; Farmers’ Welfare, Government of Meghalaya. The objective of the scheme is to provide agricultural machinery such as power tillers/bulldozers/tractors etc. on hiring at subsidised rate.\n",
  "eligibility": "\n1. The applicant should be a resident of Meghalaya.\n1. The applicant should be a bonafide farmer engaged in agriculture.\n\n",
